                <Placemark id="623">
                    <name>Radar estimate (unconfirmed, EXCLUDED): MESH 3.75in OH (Harrison/Jefferson Co. area)</name>
                    <description>Radar estimate (unconfirmed) - Radar estimate (MESH). EXCLUDED - radar-only MESH, no ground confirmation: 7 cell(s), max 3.75" (eastern Ohio); 0 C/I buildings &gt;=10k SF inside or within ~1.4 mi; no hail LSR or SPC hail report (SPC 261103 has 0 hail reports); HailTrace 11/3 public page shows 0 properties at 1"+ hail. Likely non-hail radar artifact (November stratiform/bright-band).</description>
